  "lockedDecisions": [
    "Folo supplies account, subscription, feed, entry, read, collection and source discovery data only.",
    "Folo paid AI, membership, plan, power, wallet, payment, upgrade CTA and AI Chat are removed from the product and denied by proxy policy.",
    "RSS subscription storage is preserved and must never be removed by name-based deletion.",
    "All browser business requests go to 127.0.0.1:3000.",
    "User AI keys exist only in OS Keychain and AI provider endpoints are selected from built-in presets.",
    "Home uses a persisted seven-day unread daily queue with initial size 50 and same-day hard limit 60.",
    "Normal search navigates to /search without mutating Home; the AI icon opens an in-place filter sheet.",
    "OpenAPI, JSON Schema, SQLite migrations and Folo route policy require a spec amendment before change."
  ],
